<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN BROKERS DIERICKX, LEYS SET UP LUXEMBOURG CO.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN BROKERS DIERICKX, LEYS SET UP LUXEMBOURG CO.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Antwerp-based stock brokerage Dierickx, Leys &amp; Co. NV on Wednesday confirmed a newspaper report it had set up a Luxembourg subsidiary.</p>
<p>The subsidiary, Dierickx, Leys Luxembourg SA has a capital of 25 million Belgian francs represented by 25 shares. The company was set up on May 31, the Luxemburger Wort newspaper said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
